      ":question/problem": "A snack company ships boxes of chips in two sizes. Each small box contains $7$ bags of chips, and each large box contains $12$ bags. A total of $213$ bags of chips were shipped. If $9$ of the boxes contained $12$ bags each, and the remaining are $7$-bag boxes, how many $7$-bag boxes were shipped?"
